    "description": "Enlighten is the monitoring experience built specifically for the system owner. Delivering at-a-glance verification, Enlighten gives you the assurance that your Enphase system is performing as expected.\r\n\r\n- Verify system health and performance.\r\n- View energy production by month, day, or hour. \r\n- Analyse performance against historical weather data.\r\n- Run reports of energy production and energy usage from the app",
